  title: "A Note Under the Flowers"
  body: "Ted \u2014\nToday's the last day. Tomorrow they'll pack you away.\nI come and touch that spot every day. Still dry.\nThat day on the phone I told you the door's open, you'll see it when you come back.\nI never closed it.\n\u2014 Lily"
  hand: 2
